      "title": "Add per-key rate limiting to the public API",
      "body": "Adds a token bucket per API key so one noisy client cannot starve the others.\n\n<!-- Describe how you tested this. -->\n\n## Plan\n\n- [x] Count requests per key in Redis\n- [x] Return 429 from the public API middleware when a key is over its limit\n- [ ] Tune the limit per plan tier\n\n## Notes\n\nLimits default to 100 requests a minute."
